<title>USA: U.S. weekly national grain stocks by region - USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. weekly national grain stocks by region - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>PORTLAND 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>National stocks of grain, in thousand bushels, as reported by the USDA.</p>
<p>		   Wheat   Corn  Soybeans Pct filled</p>
<p> Atlantic cst    2017    502    5141    65</p>
<p> Great Lakes    21780  11894   10335    27</p>
<p> River Points   13090  27004   23013    38</p>
<p> Southwest	10799   9157     662    20</p>
<p> Gulf Points     9154   8100    8171    34</p>
<p> Plains Area    29776  28637    3293    40</p>
<p> Pacific NW	8296   2655     unq    35</p>
<p> Grand Total    94912  87949   50615    34</p>
